 "notes": "Final governor field: Zucco (PL), Juliana Brizola (PDT), Gabriel Souza (MDB), Marcelo Maranata (PSDB) plus minor candidates (Priscila Voigt UP, Rejane de Oliveira PSTU, Cesar Pontes PCO) summed into Outros. RTBD 2026-03-16 and Futura 2026-04-07 use the scenario without Edegar Pretto (PT, not a candidate); Futura's scenario has no Maranata. Futura Souza value: Gazeta gives 9.1, Wikipedia 9.2. Quaest 2026-08-23: only Zucco/Brizola/Souza and BN 12 + undecided 27 were available (others <3% combined, not itemised); its 2nd round BNI not published in the source read. Real Time Big Data 2026-09-24/28 governor numbers are published only in valid votes, so its 1st and 2nd round rows were dropped (its senate row is kept). RTBD reports very low BNI (3-10%) in the stimulated question compared with Quaest (33-43%); these are the published figures. AtlasIntel 2026-09-01 fieldwork: Gazeta/Revista Fórum say Aug 27-Sep 1 (Poder360 summary suggested Sep 1-3). AtlasIntel 2nd round values for 2026-09-20 are total votes from Jornal do Comércio (Gazeta only gave valid). Methodus (Feb 2026) skipped: only scenario includes Pretto. Neokemp senate Rigotto 5.8% is far below other institutes (9-15%), verified verbatim in Gazeta.",
